ll on you, demons - UNLEASH THE FLAMES!","source_tag":"_t","target":"多数人只会逃跑，但我明白：遥远的星球，饱受蹂躏，深陷诅咒。焦灼的造物寻求正义的复仇，乌鲁洛克的余烬，如今已成毁灭的工具。驾驭他们的力量！捕获并驯服他们！我召唤你们，恶魔——释放烈焰！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a70b7d037fa0cbad8c993a9990ea38b2b5591db2624adb7e87b90ccffd625e03","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"2133f78029793465ed4941f303b7282dc7c7e1521f286f49c44c76767e3d6242","logical_entry_identity":"7db0ae4daf5b84a43e07ec37d8d8fac7dd2eba0e1536dff053621dc6128eda12","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"This demon is dedicated to #{italic}#extracting#{normal}# information from #{italic}#willing#{normal}# subjects.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个恶魔致力于从受试者身上#{italic}#提取#{normal}#信息——当然，他们都是#{italic}#自愿#{normal}#的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"410f7edb366b785c1c69c2a55c06e885c5d42d530b103756e76e747080387366","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"2b3e15fe6a08594d8f51d5b95b667e69429d08c2c69008a7daef901c22975638","logical_entry_identity":"a2bc9ab1173a328de102891c341f4f6652c511652d7f6d98e53d9c34aeb8e4ec","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"\"An innocuous bauble. Until you look through the hole.\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"勿视其中，安然无恙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"764fcdfce07d1b2fdd0ec0912accefce303528293533005c1eda743cd6208a33","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"2b7014d1a5c500ff2e952973172487b5ac59143fc1049caee9b8598e1385e3b8","logical_entry_identity":"3ce8f1d3515148f119755a6e16b454ba76cfbdc157e0b9200c93e235cc787dbe","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"A hastily written message.","source_tag":"_t","target":"匆忙写下的信息。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"246d5a06e41f4f7ed5338a7e6489bc3ffbb6f59a46bd9b83f57c029acce2914e","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"2b778e156c92229366504d05ca4f170be5b4460c99d4e5d0aeed205a8b160ac4","logical_entry_identity":"c7fe4fb31a88ede75cd682736ddb7e874b352663077904b349271be5b722983d","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","sourc