ource_tag":"tformat","target":"恢复#904010#%0.2f活力值"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b0e7cb447e1966147eba0642265fea6d635c9de99ee35d6f4f60162033481981","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"3080249808728853927c3b7ab6c41f5f92bbcb24e5126c10c61908ee4467357f","logical_entry_identity":"e2414ceca2a116e07d9a351c89323d7ea72a6288d991ca283f3d3399808d05f9","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"All damage you deal is converted to darkness.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的所有伤害转化为暗影伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b44008be6fc2cdbd6fc0a557c238122b4992d1be97e17b5aae9d70029904b3f1","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"30a0d00ba59395d5ed0118559f9e2af9538f8255a48f6d4397270eb70514b587","logical_entry_identity":"a39c9007c1b83937b02dc266cebc1aa0fcf4afb460318120b91275e7fd5d0909","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Well Seeded","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"种子培育专家"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d60d9174cd1c60ce466aa1b63ff6bbbcfd2df3eac87053fed98bd5382c9ddd3","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"30f8760fe2475358318cbed8e8c7990c4816647eacb55910ff6a9eb6dba0f04c","logical_entry_identity":"7608ad07ba5313bd484158d7c62c207c8174fe091c9ef922fc231bfd06cd6b7e","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Your affinity for the shadows grow stronger.\n\t\tWhenever one of your spells deal darkness damage you have a %d%% chance to gain 8%% to all damage affinity for 8 turns.\n\t\tIf you kill a creature with darkness damage this effect always triggers.\n\t\tYou can only gain one stack of Dark Reign per turn.\n\t\tThis effect stacks multiplicatively up to %d times.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你与阴影的联系更加紧密了。\n\t\t每次你使用法术造成暗影伤害时，你有 %d%% 几率获得 8%% 全体伤害亲和，持续 8 回合。\n\t\t如果你用暗影伤害杀死一个生物，这一效果必定触发。\n\t\t你每回合最多只能获得一层黑暗支配效果。\n\t\t这个效果能叠加至最多 %d 层。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"04579f7ae40977b5654776fff95ff553e77d22b14adf3abb260c9594f6501798","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"312601f8d09ad68a9be650547a6445866db7330cdef7cc79f63a2618b2f6c36c","logical_entry_identity":"834c67d10e66b5ac933a2d66304dfee91174f073450e7cc1db37a7a145393707","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"You unleash the fury of the Spellblaze, constantly draining your vim.\n\t\tWhile this spell is active at most two meteors will fall near your per turn, dealing %0.2f physical and %0.2f fire damage in radius 2.\n\t\tThis spell disabled automatically on rest or run.\n\t\tThe effects increase with spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你释放魔法大爆炸的力量，持续消耗活力。\n\t\t当技能开启时，每回合至多有 2 个陨石坠落在你身边，在半径 2 的范围内造成 %0.2f 物理与 %0.2f 火焰伤害。\n\t\t这项法术在休息或跑步时自动关闭。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"18326abbc408f0eeb670eef4ac8af496328f3c9742c4891a3527a598f2c07393","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"318a0c4d708d54d45d22616e4cc54f1aca74a57df6a11f4f769e393cdbfdb383","logical_entry_identity":"016609ebdc9ab89b6f4c21724206a0d8ee9d22928bcb809ea5bfadbed072fadc","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"The modified children of emerald, known as the Wretchlings, willingly accept their role as the arrows in Urh'Rok's quiver, and most only live to see a couple of engagements before giving their lives in battle.  Once in a great while, though, one will stand toe-to-toe with the enemy and repeatedly come out on top.  These outstanding fighters, chosen by fate and their own talent, are recalled, then put through a series of tests to ensure that their survival was not due to luck alone.  Roughly 70% of these are then assigned to breeding duties, ensuring that the Wretchling bloodline gets ever stronger as it is forged in the fires of combat; the rest, whether due to sterility, consuming too much resources to sustain their brood, or simply insisting on staying in the fights for which they were created, are nurtured to maturity and once again let loose on the battlefield.  If wretchlings are our arrows, wretch titans are our trebuchet boulders, causing a tremendous amount of damage to the enemy line with their incredible strength and the geysers of acid spurting from their flesh.  Although no less aggressive than their younger counterparts, wretch titans generally have a much higher survival rate, due to not only their formidable power and size, but the sheer terror they cause when charging at the enemy - few Eyalites would stand and fight against such a foe, particularly when it means standing in a rapidly-growing pool of acid.","source_tag":"_t","target":"绿翡翠的孩子们，酸液树魔，愉快地接受了作为乌鲁洛克之箭的身份，大部分在战死前都只能见证几次战斗。但少数情况下，也会有个体在面对面的厮杀中取得持续的胜利。这些卓越的被命运和他们自身天赋选定的近战专家，将被召回做检测，以确保并非是全然的幸运令其生存。其中约 70% 会被指派承担繁殖任务，让酸液树魔的血统在战火熔炉中不断变得更加强壮；其余的，不论是因为无法生育、消耗过多资源喂养后代，还是坚持留在为之而生的战场上，都会被培育成熟后再次放回战场。如果说酸液树魔是我们的箭矢，那么腐化泰坦就是投石机抛出的巨石，以不可思议的力量和从血肉中喷涌的酸液对敌军战线造成巨大破坏。他们不比酸液树魔杀伤力小，同时生存率要高得多——这不仅仅是因为他们的力量和体积，更是因为他们面对敌人时制造的恐惧——几乎无人能站在他们面前肉搏，尤其是在地表上有不断扩张的强酸池时。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"512d7be1a399ac1db075ddf33b748dc150e462d99b10a12fd2cc5b9b3741d084","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"31eda85aa9135e9214d3cdf8bae9e6a85c79b2ce7f2405cf1657d49d9342ae3d","logical_entry_identity":"48d87f8aaffc4091cb030357b96a088d491b4a686c7d38003a9c2e774dd02851","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Murderer","source_tag":"_t","target":"屠戮"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"330f4deac05577b88229ad65a5e6b7473e175decc341d757c9aac51af5858e8c","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"32399de6ae7225852dc028148d5a1c263ca874673c40f6824a48cc41190116d6","logical_entry_identity":"4cc94ea026d0b73beb677d969f01571496e11184fe11110fb7f373f7c829f9e8","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"and raised as a demonic husk","source_tag":"_t","target":"并以恶魔尸傀的形式重生"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2042a64cf6be548c396a1ca2c3b67610fd432b474bc8db0213a273dd4e45bda3","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"3247c709ffcdefd347bb9d5e599b5a0e000f13849500b9a57385977aafd744e5","logical_entry_identity":"65a079611c8