until level %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在达到等级%d之前，不能解除装备和重置。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1c13bd4e09caf9f2ee750c8c96e701604f8cdc5ca5506ac899241f94f68f89c9","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"34499d590ae4e2d5698f1aebad10dd69ce8157ba0d9f51fe77d63b47318e5715","logical_entry_identity":"6e6f727f211898c84893584e289e6e11fcede64acf3400549a95390fd9bb098c","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"investigator","source_tag":"entity name","target":"恶魔调查者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f41c1cc18fc76c3e7131a9d24b36633ee754421bf586776fb493161f9c09c668","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"345933d3202bbcd46403359cab7e3610c2834dc3d411f346408bf3c64c42e12e","logical_entry_identity":"7f7a9f30343fcae92f2b515d41fe1dfe0e3afbe4b9b67942b186999ae47cc4f7","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#[fight]#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#[战斗]#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bb0cabe340a3756c28ab6261138d99f8f21ca0833b7d10ceddf19f7c848379dc","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"34b11581823f1caf882fc6c8ac0ccf5622928b80ae44a5c90bb16168543e8b56","logical_entry_identity":"42bdabf8312daac34a8f1f27dc4ba91a86b5b5a31b627e9ddb7462e9f34e64d2","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Use your stored vim to supercharge your body, recovering %d stamina and %d life.\n\t\tAdditionally, you will be able to survive your HP going under 0, down to -%d HP, for the next 8 turns.\n\t\tThese values will increase with your Spellpower.\n\t\tSpell criticals with this talent also effect the stamina gain.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用体内蕴藏的活力强化自己的身体，恢复 %d 点体力值和 %d 点生命值。\n\t同时让你在 -%d 生命时才会死亡，此效果持续 8 回合。\n\t恢复值受法术强度加成。\n\t法术暴击也会增加这一技能恢复的体力值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3eba8578352e2298748a178847bc231a48f3446f7fe5dc5187c613f326e02a8d","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"3504fb30fcf30dad16bcb0a1085fc4d001507e1b0a26effb576e93458e107a54","logical_entry_identity":"1dae8350ea5a0f484304933daeb32bf583c79a982183940b48e26a8cbf94ac32","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"a ruin banshee","source_tag":"_t","target":"一只毁灭女妖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3c4d6f3a708abf53e3c6c2e6cfade3f82913ea231cdecc80a0f636854a6e2726","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"35145a48f7d1f646e45372974420266212d4729a5e4da2b2292e759b0b19edca","logical_entry_identity":"126178000798a40db6fcbe3666e6cfe1c825726f244963638c387ef21a847187","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Fetid Breath","source_tag":"talent name","target":"恶臭吐息"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d9a1d5636bc59aedf45256378cf4ca7e14364dae685a0fc73565b114200bd056","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"357c6100fcf4520cdea9dcab236c39298343175f3af9cc935d9406840953f635","logical_entry_identity":"542a73ae5630a341d32144d5da1d9e9386255ae31740360f87853c063cbef6f5","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#The power of the Fearscape touches %s and fades away, leaving a nasty effect upon you.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#CRIMSON#恶魔空间的力量触及了%s，然后消褪了，留下一个负面效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"004acc225b521836d00c08b1f8c2fe4f49b28be2cb4834aa4907ccedcb3483a4","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"35fff25c354caba54c9b9bc5b0b804032edf8f8b53509c4c1a307f419bbc2c71","logical_entry_identity":"87c3b89b295c77f9f3a91aa37998a8b40ed782fbd38bcf7cfb7284ad35f1c149","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Demonic Horns 8","source_tag":"_t","target":"恶魔角8"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"889811a6484d4c5570fc29c4ef85989d1505b10b505ad197524261fe610674d8","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"366441d61621de3897a853771324e3a678f20e2c4690023bf5ddff861e6c5ae1","logical_entry_identity":"406952ddd5751beed59ec50403f016bd899340395e4b6080c907f86e7ba54bd4","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"All damage affinity increased by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"全体伤害亲和提升%d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a056c40c6bb49a09a4efd236f6c2cf2065eb9474101c018902a132ada04f1f99","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"368ba81f9792baeb708110174a04de1a7018ac4f81918eab0771d59790537f44","logical_entry_identity":"72d04dfea4b0f65a3d25713413c4e7531c05a0a24cf580e9180a9cd0335fcfd1","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#Target#'s weapon looks less threatening.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#的危险度看起来降低了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c695c446a486f4855e338ddd0f9a879c90af2152f92453248ffa75e85b1bb794","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"36a250255f81d05264ec39cd754a17917cb5674ab67466b7f74eba89f62a3a37","logical_entry_identity":"8518fa6eefc0f55272562a5bf01f889600270fc41efe4aa58bb7b85ccab8a828","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Traitor","source_tag":"_t","target":"背叛"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"03e0ae31cbad78d1600c2fa3758ab507b67248a161819765ff01265d6439a287","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"36b3f549f6ac4aa98caa8a698f3728c100baff7f9b3309d02fbeeac62f2d2904","logical_entry_identity":"722a20eef833223e446b74eccb01f02e75934bf220eaf792d4fc447247e86b68","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#Target# is on fire!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#着火了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"61ed0d1a31856cacc808058f4eca45e1c9c20a8db7cd64a44f2869ccb290f050","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"3703023121b9d40d86a908b8a81d5245dd6401f87fd5180406b2acaa3c93026b","logical_entry_identity":"eec3715d20e334ef153f0a93bbae939d75ba7873cfa1a5ea74e187acafdab890","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Demons in their invasion of Eyal have abducted natives of the planet and mindwiped them to serve as double agents.\nTrained in the use of the demon's own forces they have created many dark cults to spread fear and terror.\nSome have managed to escape their programming and chose to follow their own desires instead.\n\nYou have defeated countless demons, seen how their essence work, witnessed how to bind demons to your own purpose and can now create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Demonologist class#WHITE#.\n\nCorruptors are spellcasters, ranged attackers using magic.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Infect your foes with demonic seeds.\n- Bind demonic seeds to your equipment to enhance them.\n- Summon and control demons to do your binding.\n- Blend corrupted magic with a martial shield training to protect yourself and ruin your foes.#WHITE#\n\nCorruptors use \"vim\" to power their special abilities.\nVim is the life force of all beings. It does not regenerate, and can only be stolen from your foes.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"在入侵埃亚尔大陆的过程中，恶魔绑架了这颗星球的居民，将他们洗脑后训练为双面间谍。\n\n他们接受使用恶魔之力的训练，并通过黑暗仪式来传播不安与恐慌。\n\n也有一些人成功逃脱了恶魔的控制，选择追随自己的渴望与意志。\n\n你打败了无数的恶魔，掌握了他们本质的运作，见证了如何束缚恶魔为你所用，现在在你创建人物时可以选择新的职业 #LIGHT_GREEN#恶魔使者#WHITE#。\n\n堕落系是施法职业，能使用魔法攻击敌人。\n职业特点：#YELLOW#\n- 向敌人注射恶魔之种\n- 将恶魔种子附着在装备上，以强化装备效果\n- 召唤并控制恶魔\n- 将堕落魔法与盾牌战技结合，保护自己并毁灭敌人。#WHITE#\n\n堕落者使用活力值来施放他们的法术。\n活力是所有生物的生命力量，它不会自己回复，而必须从你的目标身上偷取。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1ae4a7182c74d4f399146a3f7942fd6a50b866698bb86214f38781b38a2d767a","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"37370de7949031116c9b3204b00f980073dc82e11c10d4ed7f3a6b94b3a5112a","logical_entry_identity":"b3ec3bfe251267f3db57a2ffcc247e05ada72dd21616c42e28aa69c8c237c2b5","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#(%d linked)#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#CRIMSON#(%d 伤害链接)#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"101b9902aa8706d1f857555ec5509ae0477bc8b38a63493b9fd4f687053445fa","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"3747432e7d1becace0f71aee4e646436a5e203e67b7c257596848f13a4084b04","logical_entry_identity":"ba497a46ffe9c093d1f6dfef10bce8eee8d757c86d99976db133d2020347943d","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"+Osmosis Regen","source_tag":"_t","target":"+渗透吸收"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"291c